06,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20321,"speakerName":"墨田","textMapHash":963611026,"text":"なんか面白そうですね！どう思いますか、カマ？","nextNodeIds":[722460107]},{"nodeId":722460107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20322,"speakerName":"カマ","textMapHash":2485055370,"text":"僕はどうでも…","nextNodeIds":[722460108]},{"nodeId":722460108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20322,"speakerName":"カマ","textMapHash":4230787242,"text":"……","nextNodeIds":[722460109]},{"nodeId":722460109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20322,"speakerName":"カマ","textMapHash":2700944346,"text":"個人的には…「花瓶」を描写する文章の量はきちんと考慮したほうがいいと思う。過剰に描写してしまうと、その意図がバレてしまう。だが、描写が不足していると、唐突になってしまうことがある。","nextNodeIds":[722460110]},{"nodeId":722460110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20321,"speakerName":"墨田","textMapHash":3067225922,"text":"おお、その通りですね！メモしておきます…","nextNodeIds":[722460111]},{"nodeId":722460111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20321,"speakerName":"墨田","textMapHash":3828776970,"text":"あっ、ごめんなさい！場所を変えましょう。","nextNodeIds":[722460112]},{"nodeId":722460112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20321,"speakerName":"墨田","textMapHash":3438718522,"text":"あと、何回も言いましたが、私に「様」をつけないでください。","nextNodeIds":[722460113]},{"nodeId":722460113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20321,"speakerName":"墨田","textMapHash":381172298,"text":"ん？しかし考えてみれば、普通の旅人二人のうち、一人がもう一人を「様」と呼ぶことも珍しいことではありませんね。","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7224601,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_NONE","LNHLPKELCAL":[],"NOCCOBOFKHP":0,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NONE"}}},{"su